## Stack - with 'split after'

<SqueezeContainer>
	<div class="test-container">
		<div class="l-stack">
			<span class="item">Item</span>
			<span class="item">Item</span>
			<span class="item">Item</span>
			<span class="item item--margin-block-end">margin-block-end: auto</span>
			<span class="item">Item</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</SqueezeContainer>

## Stack - with 'split after' and extra item

The stack should not be split because it is not the only child of its parent.

<SqueezeContainer>
	<div class="test-container">
		<span class="item item-extra">This is an extra item, outside of the stack.</span>
		<div class="l-stack">
			<span class="item">Item</span>
			<span class="item">Item</span>
			<span class="item">Item</span>
			<span class="item item--margin-block-end">margin-block-end: auto</span>
			<span class="item">Item</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</SqueezeContainer>